# Assessment engine

One attempt per student. Auto-grade only. Third integrity strike →
`integrity_stopped`. Full review after submit. Cards live on the day page.

## Authoring

- Prompt: `public/assessment-authoring-prompt.md`
- Validate: `src/lib/assessment-schema.ts` (`sdaia-assessment/v1`) — most
  authoring rules are hard errors; word-cue style checks stay warnings
- Import also confirms file day + duration against the selected assessment
- Import/edit RPCs refuse if attempts exist → Reset attempts first

## Runtime

- Student route: `/quiz/[assessmentId]` under `(quiz)` layout
- Actions: `src/app/actions/quiz.ts` → RPCs
- Never return answer keys mid-attempt; options have no correctness column

## After schema/RPC changes

Re-run the security checklist in `docs/ASSESSMENTS.md`, regenerate
`src/lib/types.ts`, and call `revalidateCourseContent` from question mutations.
